# Environment Variables

## Development Environment

```env
# API Configuration
API_URL=http://localhost:3000/api
API_TIMEOUT=5000

# Feature Flags
ENABLE_ANALYTICS=false
ENABLE_DEBUG=true

# Application
APP_NAME=Siddhivinayak Laundry
APP_VERSION=1.0.0
```

## Production Environment

```env
# API Configuration
API_URL=https://api.siddhivinayak.com/api
API_TIMEOUT=5000

# Feature Flags
ENABLE_ANALYTICS=true
ENABLE_DEBUG=false

# Application
APP_NAME=Siddhivinayak Laundry
APP_VERSION=1.0.0
```

## Instructions

1. Copy this file to `.env.local` in the frontend directory
2. Update values as needed for your environment
3. Never commit `.env` files with sensitive data
4. Use Angular environments instead for build-time configuration
